    "title": "Literacy path — Wave 17",
    "description": "Seventeenth production literacy slice: language spark plus writing look. Compact two-unit wave. Utterances نَعَم and لَا, joiner وَ, coordinated phrase وَلَد وَبِنْت, citation writing exposure بِنْت. No new phonics class, no new consonant, no damma, no sentence, no article, no tanween, no Wave 18.",
